+# Wire Format
+
+This project has no current recorded decision specifying a wire serialisation format. A repository-wide search of the documentation and codebase turned up no policy, decision record, ADR, or RFC establishing one; the only related material is incidental documentation on how to plug in a custom JSON codec at runtime, which does not constitute a project decision on the wire format. Until such a decision is recorded, none should be assumed.
